Rendered frames in `preview.jpg` and `full.jpg` are released under the same CC BY 4.0 terms, with the same attribution requirement, unless a case states otherwise.

## The prompts describe generative output, not a warranty

These prompts are records of what produced the published frames with the model and settings printed on each case. Generative output is not deterministic: re-running a prompt may produce a different image. A case documents what happened, not what will always happen.

